{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Peck peck peck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pecking through endless dirt and uncover new underground biomes. Each area brings new materials, weird customers, and strange surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/f03125dac17a304bbad2b2e8d7c50093.poster.avif?t=1774643355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/f03125dac17a304bbad2b2e8d7c50093.webm?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/f03125dac17a304bbad2b2e8d7c50093.mp4?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Excuse Me, One Gear Please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From brave adventurers to clueless peasants, they all descend into your underground smithy. One wants heavy armor, another insists on something enchanted and oddly specific. You can\u2019t exactly say no, so you\u2019d better dig up the goods and hammer out whatever bizarre equipment they\u2019re asking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/e4b74a5cca6c066cc68d355df415e5d0.poster.avif?t=1774643355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/e4b74a5cca6c066cc68d355df415e5d0.webm?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/e4b74a5cca6c066cc68d355df415e5d0.mp4?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Birdsmithing 101</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes and forge questionable equipment to meet their demands. Craft a <i>Tater Jerkin</i> from potatoes for crunchy, fried protection but will it actually keep them alive long enough to share the loot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/7ff83a83b918150535e307b8da08d814.avif?t=1774643355\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras_big/7ff83a83b918150535e307b8da08d814.webp?t=1774643355 width=1560 height=509 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Encounters and Discoveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover odd encounters and make choices that leads to rewards or disasters. Do you peck open the mysterious box or leave it be? Do you rescue the goblin stuck under a boulder\u2026 or pretend you didn\u2019t see him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/6e0eab5bb7c9cc0fcc211f3ceac49ea1.poster.avif?t=1774643355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/6e0eab5bb7c9cc0fcc211f3ceac49ea1.webm?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/6e0eab5bb7c9cc0fcc211f3ceac49ea1.mp4?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/25bc7d6ef8dd0f98cc18c55a8985517f.poster.avif?t=1774643355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/25bc7d6ef8dd0f98cc18c55a8985517f.webm?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/25bc7d6ef8dd0f98cc18c55a8985517f.mp4?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle in the corner!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peckers is designed to be your quirky corner companion. Dig, craft, and play at your own pace while it happily runs in the corner of your screen. Collapse, resize, or move it anywhere you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/287ea8dccc402bf3c5ac26e5f0946a0d.poster.avif?t=1774643355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/287ea8dccc402bf3c5ac26e5f0946a0d.webm?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/287ea8dccc402bf3c5ac26e5f0946a0d.mp4?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.poster.avif?t=1774643355\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.webm?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.mp4?t=1774643355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060780?t=1774643355","background_ra